    "name": "Cosmic Composer",
    "steam_appid": 3459990,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459990/extras/8574174e74c568aa294b569397aea929.poster.avif?t=1749592924\" width=608 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459990/extras/8574174e74c568aa294b569397aea929.webm?t=1749592924\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459990/extras/8574174e74c568aa294b569397aea929.mp4?t=1749592924\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place celestial bodies and complete quests to build your cosmos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quests can be completed by placing required objects nearby.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Completing quests award more moves and can trigger astronomical events like supernova or create a black hole.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Events can modify already placed objects and change your cosmos in creative ways.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maybe even life can evolve in one of the solar systems...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459990/extras/d5db84e7260a6d37432ec7a70dae8588.poster.avif?t=1749592924\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459990/extras/d5db84e7260a6d37432ec7a70dae8588.webm?t=1749592924\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459990/extras/d5db84e7260a6d37432ec7a70dae8588.mp4?t=1749592924\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459990/extras/8574174e74c568aa294b569397aea929.poster.avif?t=1749592924\" width=608 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459990/extras/8574174e74c568aa294b569397aea929.webm?t=1749592924\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459990/extras/8574174e74c568aa294b569397aea929.mp4?t=1749592924\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place celestial bodies and complete quests to build your cosmos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quests can be completed by placing required objects nearby.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Completing quests award more moves and can trigger astronomical events like supernova or create a black hole.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Events can modify already placed objects and change your cosmos in creative ways.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maybe even life can evolve in one of the solar systems...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459990/extras/d5db84e7260a6d37432ec7a70dae8588.poster.avif?t=1749592924\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459990/extras/d5db84e7260a6d37432ec7a70dae8588.webm?t=1749592924\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459990/extras/d5db84e7260a6d37432ec7a70dae8588.mp4?t=1749592924\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "short_description": "Cosmic Composer is a relaxing building and puzzle game in space. Place celestial bodies to create colorful nebulas, star clusters and solar systems. Explode stars as supernovae and shape the ever-changing cosmos.",
    "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, German, Simplified Chinese, Italian, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Korean, Portuguese - Brazil, Spanish - Latin America<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
